issues that are essential to survival.  Magic resistance and illness
come to mind.  It seems very unlikely to me that an unspoiled character
will ascend before the player has at least once made the experience of
dying due to not having magic resistance.  (It is not impossible: if
Ellora had found gray dragon scales early on, she would have realized in
a shop that it is more expensive than others and might have chosen to
make gray dragon scale mail instead of green one.  The she would have
had magic resistance without knowing it.)  If he finds the right altar
before meeting Pestilence, he might get by without knowing about getting
deathly sick.  Ellora would have been able to, as she had evaded Juiblex
without ever learning about his illness attack.  In Nethack, IIRC the
only other creatures making you ill are Demogorgon, Scorpius, and
Pestilence whom you all don't have to meet.  (Juiblex is normally
inevitable, except in the rare circumstances that Ellora met.)

Nevertheless, I expected Ellora to ascend...  At least I was right in
